2
00:05:58,359 --> 00:06:02,039
僕たち6人は配信アプリ「ホロキャス」で活動する配信者。
We six are streamers on the streaming app "Holocast."

3
00:06:02,399 --> 00:06:08,179
突然画面に吸い込まれてアプリとつながる謎の世界ホロキャス界に来ちゃった！？
Suddenly sucked into the screen, we ended up in the mysterious Holocast world connected to the app?!

4
00:06:08,179 --> 00:06:14,399
そこでは現実で苦しむ人の魂が怪物化してしまう現象、夢堕ちが起きていた。
There, a phenomenon where people's souls suffering in reality turned into monsters was happening.

5
00:06:14,399 --> 00:06:19,019
怪物コロプサーを倒して、みんなの魂を取り戻さないと！
We have to defeat the monster Coropsars and reclaim everyone's souls!

6
00:06:19,019 --> 00:06:23,469
そうして私たちは魔法少女に変身して戦うことになった。
And so, we transformed into magical girls and had to fight.

7
00:06:23,469 --> 00:06:27,829
みんなの心を助けて夢を応援しよ！
Saving everyone's hearts and cheering on their dreams—

8
00:06:27,829 --> 00:06:31,139
それが魔法少女ホロウィッチ！
that is Magical Girl Holowitch!

9
00:06:37,395 --> 00:06:41,395
私、もっと大人になったら魔法になりたい。
When I grow up, I want to become magic.

10
00:06:41,395 --> 00:06:45,395
もっといろんな人を励げるの…
To be able to encourage so many people...

11
00:06:50,577 --> 00:06:54,677
面倒な仕事、みんな私に押し付けて丸投げして。
Piling all their troublesome work onto me and dumping it.

12
00:06:54,677 --> 00:06:58,757
やったらやったですきかって言って、
Saying whatever they want after I do it—

13
00:06:58,757 --> 00:07:00,657
何なのよ。
What is this?!

14
00:07:21,371 --> 00:07:24,041
みなさん、こんにちは！
Hello everyone!

15
00:07:24,041 --> 00:07:28,101
会場にお越しいただきありがとうございます！
Thank you for coming to the venue!

16
00:07:28,471 --> 00:07:31,101
さて、本日はここからスペシャルの称号…
Now, from here today, special titles...

17
00:07:31,964 --> 00:07:33,994
ちょっと待ってもらおうか！！
Hold on a second!!

18
00:07:38,264 --> 00:07:41,884
ずいぶん人が集まってんじゃねえか。
Looks like quite a lot of people have gathered here.

19
00:07:43,354 --> 00:07:45,654
あなたたち何者ですか？
Who on earth are you guys?

20
00:07:46,074 --> 00:07:54,034
我ら人間どもの欲望と絶望の糞尿箱垂れ流して、夢を堕ちさせる！
Spilling the cesspool of human desires and despair, we make dreams fall!

21
00:07:54,354 --> 00:07:57,664
それが俺たちコロプサー！
That's us, Coropsars!

22
00:07:57,974 --> 00:08:06,644
大変！この時はあの子たちを呼ぶしかない！皆さんも声を揃えて呼んでくださいね！せーの！
Oh no! At a time like this, we have no choice but to call those girls! Everyone, please call out together! Ready, go!

23
00:08:09,124 --> 00:08:12,614
助けて！ホロウィッチ！
Help us, Holowitch!

24
00:08:12,934 --> 00:08:14,344
なんだ？
What?!

25
00:08:35,328 --> 00:08:41,878
この手を差し伸べ、掴んで、握る！天使のホロ、魔法少女、かなた！
Reach out this hand, grasp it, and hold on! Angelic Holo, Magical Girl Kanata!

26
00:08:43,096 --> 00:08:49,046
みんなの願いを叶える祈り、巫女のホロ、魔法少女みこ！
A prayer granting everyone's wishes, Shrine Maiden Holo, Magical Girl Miko!

27
00:08:50,088 --> 00:08:56,408
甘い幸せお裾分け、姫のホロ、魔法少女ルーナ！
Sharing sweet happiness, Princess Holo, Magical Girl Luna!

28
00:08:57,357 --> 00:09:04,297
きらめくお宝ロックオン！海賊のホロ、魔法少女マリン！
Locking onto sparkling treasures! Pirate Holo, Magical Girl Marine!

29
00:09:05,426 --> 00:09:11,426
眠れる深淵のわがままに、魔女のホロ、魔法少女シオン！
Following the selfish whims of the sleeping abyss, Witch Holo, Magical Girl Shion!

30
00:09:12,347 --> 00:09:19,077
荒波を行く半妖の剣、侍のホロ、魔法少女いろは！
A half-youkai sword braving rough seas, Samurai Holo, Magical Girl Iroha!

31
00:09:20,157 --> 00:09:24,487
ホロウィッチ、ドリームキャスト！
Holowitch, Dreamcast!

32
00:09:38,262 --> 00:09:44,212
君に魔法をかけるよ ウィークステイルの夜
Casting magic on you on the night of the weak's tale...

33
00:09:53,021 --> 00:09:59,821
始まりを告げる衝動が響く 気づいた時がいずだっ…
The impulse signaling the beginning echoes, when I realized...

34
00:10:00,336 --> 00:10:02,136
甘くて幸せなこと
I'll make a treat so sweet and full of fun,

35
00:10:02,136 --> 00:10:04,576
隠し味何にしよう
but I wanna hide a little bit of love.

36
00:10:04,576 --> 00:10:07,136
純粋な乙女心
Pure like a gem, a maiden's eager heart,

37
00:10:07,136 --> 00:10:09,936
甘い恋も絡めなくちゃ
gotta mix it all in from the very start.

38
00:10:09,936 --> 00:10:12,736
切なさ重ねてミルフィーユ
Bake a layered mille-feuille with the air I sigh,

39
00:10:12,736 --> 00:10:15,636
酸味も積み上げタルト
and a sour tart of all the hurt inside.

40
00:10:15,636 --> 00:10:17,856
苦味もチョコレートケーキ?
Make it bitter with a chocolate cake, I'll breathe

41
00:10:17,856 --> 00:10:22,396
魔法かけた甘い奇跡
miracles with a spell full of sweet fantasies.

42
00:10:22,396 --> 00:10:25,576
甘さを抑えてビターとか
Should I take sugar away, have bitterness alone?

43
00:10:25,576 --> 00:10:27,776
