Kinda like a coffee without milk or foam.

44
00:10:27,776 --> 00:10:30,456
甘いだけじゃ大人になれないの?
If I still don't like the taste, am I not grown?

45
00:10:30,456 --> 00:10:34,316
そんなの絶対に絶対いやだいやだいやだ
No, it can't be! Don't wanna, wanna, wanna!

46
